Package: swiftdesk
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SwiftDesk Developers <support@swiftdesk.internal>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libx11-6, libxtst6, libpipewire-0.3-0 (>= 0.3.50)
Description: Cross-platform enterprise remote desktop and support client
 SwiftDesk delivers low-latency screen streaming, remote input injection,
 chunked integrity-checked file transfers, audited remote reboot, and
 enterprise OIDC/MFA operator authentication.
